    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109764" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑστήρια</span></b> , τά, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὗς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a festival</i> at Argos <i>in which swine were
